{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36915","headline":"漂母塚 · 罗隐","name":"漂母塚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂荒坟一水滨，芦洲绝岛自相亲。\n青娥已落淮边月，白骨甘爲泉下尘。\n原上荻花飘素髪，道傍菰叶碎罗巾。\n虽然寂寞千秋魄，犹是韩侯旧主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}